---
import Shell from '../../layouts/Shell.astro';
import Newsletter from '../../components/Newsletter.astro';
import OriginFilm from '../../components/OriginFilm.astro';
import UndergroundPopup from '../../components/UndergroundPopup.astro';
import {href} from '../../utilities/paths';
---
<Shell title="Designed in Detroit. Transmitted worldwide." path="about/" description="The creative world behind GOTHTECHNOLOGY: Detroit sound, underground gaming, industrial design, and Digital Static.">
<header class="page-heading"><span class="section-number">ORIGIN / DIGITAL STATIC</span><h1>Designed in Detroit.<br/>Transmitted worldwide.</h1></header>

<section class="section serengeti-section" aria-labelledby="serengeti-title" id="serengeti-gallery">
  <a class="serengeti-banner" href="https://robjasper2084.github.io/serengeti-gallery/">
    <img src={href('images/serengeti-gallery-atrium.png')} width="1536" height="1024" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="The warmly lit Serengeti Gallery atrium, with portrait artwork, a central tree, and a cinema." />
    <div class="serengeti-copy"><span class="section-number">DIGITAL STATIC / ART &amp; CULTURE</span><h2 id="serengeti-title">Serengeti Galleries</h2><p>Step into a world of art, cinema, and Detroit creativity. Explore the virtual gallery and discover its collection.</p><span class="serengeti-cta">Enter the gallery <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></div>
  </a>
</section>
<section class="section origin-section"><div><h2>A city.<br/>A signal.<br/>A world of your own.</h2><p>Born from Detroit sound, underground gaming, industrial design, and the glow of technology after midnight, GOTHTECHNOLOGY creates apparel and artifacts for people building their own world.</p><p>The 313 hood, the stitched skyline, the small companion on your bag. Familiar city symbols carried into an imagined future.</p><p>A creative world by Digital Static. The product references and original fighting game share one home here.</p><a class="button" href={href('shop/')}>Explore the armory →</a></div><OriginFilm/></section>


<UndergroundPopup autoSwoop swoopOnly/>
<section class="section document-page"><h2>From game world to everyday objects.</h2><p>GOTHTECHNOLOGY began here as a browser fighting game. Its characters, stages, settings, and controls remain playable. The armory extends that visual world into a concept catalog of apparel, accessories, collectibles, and digital artifacts.</p><p>All products in this preview are demo concepts. Final stock, manufacturing, commercial asset rights, and sales policies must be confirmed before the store accepts orders.</p><a class="text-link" href={href('play/')}>Enter the original game →</a></section>

<Newsletter/>
</Shell>

<style>
.serengeti-section{padding-top:0;padding-bottom:clamp(32px,5vw,72px)}
.serengeti-banner{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr 1fr;border:1px solid #88733f;background:#091013;color:#e5d3a0;text-decoration:none;overflow:hidden}
.serengeti-banner img{width:100%;height:100%;min-height:320px;object-fit:cover;display:block}
.serengeti-copy{padding:clamp(24px,4vw,64px);align-self:center}.serengeti-copy h2{font-size:clamp(30px,3.2vw,52px);line-height:1.1;margin:16px 0}.serengeti-copy p{font:16px/1.7 Arial,sans-serif;color:#e6e5df;margin:0 0 26px;max-width:46ch}
.serengeti-cta{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:28px;min-height:48px;padding:12px 20px;background:#cfa441;color:#090c0d;font:600 13px/1.4 Arial,sans-serif}.serengeti-banner:hover .serengeti-cta{background:#e3be69}.serengeti-banner:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #78d7e1;outline-offset:5px}
@media(max-width:700px){.serengeti-banner{grid-template-columns:1fr}.serengeti-banner img{height:auto;min-height:0;aspect-ratio:3/2}.serengeti-copy{padding:24px}.serengeti-copy h2{font-size:34px}}
@media(pointer:coarse){.serengeti-cta{min-height:48px;font-size:15px}.serengeti-banner:active .serengeti-cta{background:#e3be69}}
@media(max-width:700px) and (pointer:coarse){.serengeti-cta{display:flex;width:100%}}
</style>
